Name: Text to vector
Description: Convert selected lines to an R character vector expression c("a", "b", "c"). Empty lines are ignored; quotes around a line (as from Copy as path) are dropped and backslashes flipped.
Binding: addin_text_to_vector
Interactive: false

Name: Paste path from clipboard
Description: Read Windows paths from the clipboard, flip backslashes, and insert them at the cursor: one path as a quoted R string, several as a c(...) vector.
Binding: addin_paste_path
Interactive: false

Name: Fix Windows paths
Description: Replace backslashes with forward slashes in Windows-style paths. Operates on the selected text, or the entire file if nothing is selected.
Binding: addin_fix_path
Interactive: false

Name: Flip backslashes
Description: Replace all backslashes with forward slashes in the selected text.
Binding: addin_flip_backslash
Interactive: false

Name: Open in file explorer
Description: Open the selected path (or path object) in the file explorer, revealing files in their folder. With nothing selected, opens the working directory.
Binding: addin_open_in_explorer
Interactive: false
